====
let d = frame(g = ["a", "a", "b", "b"], spend = [10.0, 20.0, 30.0, 50.0], n = [1, 2, 3, 4])
d.add(spend = spend * 2, more = spend + 1)
---- exit code 0
frame · 4 rows × 4 variables

      g   spend   n   more
  1   a      20   1     21
  2   a      40   2     41
  3   b      60   3     61
  4   b     100   4    101
note: `spend` replaced the variable of that name (line 2)
